---
// components
import Section from "../../elements/Section.astro";
import Text from "../../elements/Text.astro";
---

<Section 
    aria-label="Biography"
    title="Biography"
    titleHeading=".NET Developer. Problem Solver."
>
    <Text variant={'normal'} class="text-base-400">Hi, I'm Paraskevas I. Dimitropoulos — a full-stack software developer primarily working with .NET, C#, and SQL. I build and maintain desktop and web applications for toll road operators and public transport clients, contributing across databases, backend systems, frontend maintenance, and production support, with a focus on reliability and getting things right for the people who depend on them daily.</Text>
    <Text variant={'normal'} class="text-base-400">I've been writing code professionally since February 2025, driven by curiosity as much as craft, and I care about building software that's dependable and genuinely useful in production. Outside of work, I'm an avid language learner with a deep interest in linguistics — I enjoy picking apart how languages work almost as much as how systems do.</Text>
</Section>
